{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a hot spring that will cool down the sweltering summer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a paradise where your animal guests can relax, using newly added facilities and decorations in brand-new summer-themed stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DLC Contents</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Stages: Beach, Water Park, Valley</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/1295eab3647179dc6935e73d56b1f438.poster.avif?t=1753238485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/1295eab3647179dc6935e73d56b1f438.webm?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience three new stages filled with a vibrant summer vibe!<br>Each stage includes 7 new BGM tracks, 6 letters from local residents sharing their stories, and additional decoration items to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Content: Pool</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/0f6e71545d7197577260e4f4c3ebebdb.poster.avif?t=1753238485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/0f6e71545d7197577260e4f4c3ebebdb.webm?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/0f6e71545d7197577260e4f4c3ebebdb.mp4?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design a pool in any size you like where guests can enjoy water activities.<br>Decorate it with a variety of items such as float tubes, pool buoys, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 New Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/bfc647450f9b1768fe6c73a7d801f86b.poster.avif?t=1753238485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/bfc647450f9b1768fe6c73a7d801f86b.webm?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/bfc647450f9b1768fe6c73a7d801f86b.mp4?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven new characters are waiting for you!<br>Unlock them by progressing through new stages or completing hidden conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Gameplay Element: Thirst</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/9ef5b3c4ce089fd03f16f92e83202336.avif?t=1753238485\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s easy to get thirsty while playing in the new stages!<br>Place water stations throughout the area so your staff and guests stay hydrated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Interior and Decoration Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/7ad93e66df45be250a0cfb6840a3bab6.avif?t=1753238485\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect vibe with new items inspired by beaches, surf houses, pools, and vintage resort lodges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* How to Apply the DLC</strong><br>Once purchased, the DLC content will be automatically available in-game.<br>If it's not applied, try saving and restarting the game.</p></li></ul>","backgroun