tent: Pool</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/0f6e71545d7197577260e4f4c3ebebdb.poster.avif?t=1753238485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/0f6e71545d7197577260e4f4c3ebebdb.webm?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/0f6e71545d7197577260e4f4c3ebebdb.mp4?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design a pool in any size you like where guests can enjoy water activities.<br>Decorate it with a variety of items such as float tubes, pool buoys, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 New Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/bfc647450f9b1768fe6c73a7d801f86b.poster.avif?t=1753238485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/bfc647450f9b1768fe6c73a7d801f86b.webm?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/bfc647450f9b1768fe6c73a7d801f86b.mp4?t=1753238485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven new characters are waiting for you!<br>Unlock them by progressing through new stages or completing hidden conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Gameplay Element: Thirst</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/9ef5b3c4ce089fd03f16f92e83202336.avif?t=1753238485\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s easy to get thirsty while playing in the new stages!<br>Place water stations throughout the area so your staff and guests stay hydrated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Interior and Decoration Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/extras/7ad93e66df45be250a0cfb6840a3bab6.avif?t=1753238485\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect vibe with new items inspired by beaches, surf houses, pools, and vintage resort lodges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* How to Apply the DLC</strong><br>Once purchased, the DLC content will be automatically available in-game.<br>If it's not applied, try saving and restarting the game.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sinkhole Studio","Moonlab Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3404470","name":"Maltese's Fluffy Onsen"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863950/e18696dd215491bc46cfa3445bfff66db472fa08/header.jpg?t=1753238485","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257169430,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169430/movie480.mp4?t=1752637859","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169430/movie_max.mp4?t=1752637859"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257169430/05b2a6afc52afd8ef239f70206ffe537c911c9df/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752637859","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169430/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752637859","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169430/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752637859"}}],"name":"Maltese's Fluffy Onsen - Summer Fever","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"